OL,3,GNEWSACost of maintaining council's     
OL,4,Aformer HQ soars                        
OL,6,FA council is spending nearly #90,000 a 
OL,7,Fyear maintaining its former            
OL,8,Fheadquarters which have sat empty for  
OL,9,Fthree years.                           
OL,11,FBroadland District Council has had to  
OL,12,Fspend more on the upkeep of its former 
OL,13,FThorpe Lodge offices this year due to  
OL,14,Frepeated break-ins.                    
OL,16,FSo far this year, the Norfolk council  
OL,17,Fhas spent #87,000 on the premises in   
OL,18,FThorpe St Andrew, near Norwich ` up    
OL,19,Ffrom #70,000 last year.                
